格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Gates 84.7% of tool-schema prompt tokens away for DeepSeek Harness: plugins declare themselves organs, a nerve impulse routes each command, reflex arcs fire with zero model calls, memory consolidates while idle, every failure is attributed before retry. Reproducible offline, MIT.","id":"gh:1366089972","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"agent-body","slug":"1420079678-ctrl/agent-body","topics":["agent-framework","agent-plugins","ai-agents","ai-memory","autonomous-agents","context-engineering","cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins","llm-agents","llmops","mcp","memory-consolidation","multi-agent","plugin-system","self-healing","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Gates 84.7% of tool-schema prompt tokens away for DeepSeek Harness: plugins declare themselves organ"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"s, a nerve impulse routes each command, reflex arcs fire with zero model calls, memory consolidates "},{"id":"p1s3","text":"while idle, every failure is attributed before retry. Reproducible offline, MIT."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**English** · **中文**"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# Agent‑Body"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Load the tools your task needs. Give your agent memory, reflexes, and a recovery loop.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"A plugin layer for DeepSeek Harness that routes intent to capabilities and keeps unused tool definit"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ions out of the model’s context."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"**26 organ identities · 84.7% of tool-schema tokens gated cold-start · 200+ offline assertions · MIT"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"26 organ identities · 84.7% of tool-schema tokens gated cold-start · 200+ offline assertions · MIT**"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Your agent may have hundreds of tools. A single task usually needs only a few. Agent-Body adds a run"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"time layer that decides which capabilities to expose, remembers outcomes, and attributes failures be"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"t decides which capabilities to expose, remembers outcomes, and attributes failures before retrying."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Watch the recorded demo** · **Read the benchmark** · **Install in DeepSeek Harness** · 中文"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Problem | What Agent-Body does | Evidence you can inspect |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Tool definitions consume context on every turn | Gates schemas by task intent | 48-command offline"},{"id":"p10s2","text":" benchmark: **55,154 → 8,433 estimated schema tokens on average** |\n| Routing adds another model dec"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"ision | Routes commands through deterministic intent rules | Offline end-to-end demo; routing needs "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"no model call |\n| Failures trigger unhelpful retries | Classifies causes and selects a remedy; argum"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ent errors are not retried | Recovery trace in the recorded runtime output |\n| Useful outcomes disap"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"pear between sessions | Adds persistent memory and idle consolidation through the Cortex organ | Arc"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"hitecture and included plugin source |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The **84.71% reduction is a cold-start tool-schema estimate**, not a total-prompt or billing claim. "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"The benchmark exposes **86.67% of task-declared required capabilities on the first turn**; six are c"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"apped and must be retrieved via `body_call`. A recorded installation with history shows **58% schema"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" gating**. See the full trade-off and methodology."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The body metaphor maps to concrete components: plugins are organs, intent routing is the nerve bus, "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"deterministic event handlers are reflexes, and the heartbeat coordinates state. **This is an early-s"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"tage, Windows-first project.** Host integration requires DeepSeek Harness; the offline core demo bel"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"ow runs independently."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**Try it in 30 seconds — no install, no host, no API key.** The core imports nothing outside Node bu"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ilt-ins, so a fresh\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Where it's listed"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Checked, not claimed — every entry below resolves today:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| Listing | What it is |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| `awesome-dsh-plugin` · 16.7k ★ | the main DSH plugin directory; both `dsh-organism` and `dsh-corte"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"x` are indexed as separate entries |\n| dshfind | DSH plugin search engine, with a per-repository pag"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"e |\n| `imsai-sh/awesome-deepseek-harness-plugins` | plugin hub with machine-readable catalogue entri"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"es |\n| `bruc3van/awesome-dsh-plugin` | daily-crawled DSH plugin list, human-reviewed |\n| `billLiao/a"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"wesome-dsh-plugin` | curated list, memory category |\n| `unStone/dsh-xray` | declared-capabilities sc"},{"id":"p17s6","text":"anner; carries a page for this repository |\n| `linny006/agent-framework-radar` · `llmops-radar` | li"},{"id":"p17s7","text":"ve indexes of newly shipping agent frameworks and LLMOps tooling |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"It is also the subject of the harness's official showcase thread —\n**Show Your Plugins!** discussion"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"lso the subject of the harness's official showcase thread —\n**Show Your Plugins!** discussion #7555."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Install in one line"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Two supported paths — start with the first, switch to the second if your network blocks `github.com`"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"wo supported paths — start with the first, switch to the second if your network blocks `github.com`."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Path 1 — GitHub release assets"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Versioned assets built by CI. `releases/latest/download/` always resolves to the newest release, so "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"this command does\nnot need editing when a version is bumped."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Every agent framework eventually becomes the same thing: a pile of tools, a growing list in the syst"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"em prompt, and an\nagent that forgets everything between sessions."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"It re-reads the same failure twice before learning it exists. It cannot tell you which of its own ca"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"pabilities are\nbroken. It has no idea that a plugin it depends on went offline — it just calls it an"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"d fails. And you keep paying tokens\nfor tool schemas nobody calls."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"**Agent‑Body takes the opposite bet: treat the plugin system as an organism.**"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Every plugin declares itself an *organ* — with capabilities, senses, and reflexes. Everything else i"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"s physiology: a\nnervous system that routes your commands to the right organ, a heart that pumps stat"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"e through the whole body on a\nrhythm, reflex arcs that fire without a single model call, and a heali"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"ng loop that attributes every failure before it\neven thinks about retrying."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The result is a system that gets **measurably better the more you use it**, and that stays standing "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"when you rip parts\nof it out."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## What makes it different"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 🧩 Organs are optional — the architecture is not"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Six kernels depend on no single organ: **nerve bus · heart pump · directive layer · reflex engine · "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"dissector ·\nimpulse conduction**."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Unplug a plugin and the body keeps running. Uninstalling `dsh-office-docs` was detected immediately "},{"id":"p34s2","text":"— the `craft` organ\nwent offline and its capability was **compensated by the closest overlapping org"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"an**, core integrity still green. An\norgan that is not installed at all is reported as *not installe"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"d*, not as *broken* — which eliminated a 15‑second\nwarning storm from a phantom organ."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Architecture at a glance"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Full detail — three kernels, five life mechanisms, event contracts, on‑disk state, verification meth"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"odology — lives in\n**ARCHITECTURE.md**."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
